{"content":[{"c":["HAZARMAVETH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Descendant of Shem through Joktan (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.10.26","r":"Gen.10.26","rawR":"Gen.10.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.10.26","value":"Gen.10.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 10:26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.20","r":"1Chr.1.20","rawR":"1Chr.1.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.20","value":"1Chr.1.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:20"},") whose progeny lived in southern Arabia (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.10.30","r":"Gen.10.30","rawR":"Gen.10.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.10.30","value":"Gen.10.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 10:30"},") in the Wadi Hadhramaut. Excavations there revealed a flourishing economy in the fifth century ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},", based on frankincense trade. This trade, revived in the second century ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},", made the area prosperous and influential."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hazarmaveth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 10:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.10.26","rawQueryValue":"Gen.10.26","sourceRefExact":"Gen.10.26"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.20"},{"anchorText":"Gn 10:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.10.30","rawQueryValue":"Gen.10.30","sourceRefExact":"Gen.10.30"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e7ff9cb54155e034123505e8e2a23c096b340e3aa4d7457cc80b33ac3518d5be","sourceItemName":"Hazarmaveth","sourceItemOrder":176,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hazarmaveth","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hazarmaveth","title":"Hazarmaveth","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}